{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11102170","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11102170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110217001:1":{"text":"皆さーん！戦歌祭初戦となる一回目の試練への申し込みが、間もなく終了しますよー！","source_cn":"曼卡拉的老朋友们，战歌节初赛第一道试炼领取时间，即将截止！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49EFF701E0ADFE2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110217002:1":{"text":"残り五秒！四！三！二――","source_cn":"倒计时——五！四！三！二——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB9352A03A1CBD48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110217003:1":{"text":"待って！ウール族も試練に参加する！","source_cn":"等一等！乌尔氏族想要领取试炼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8D5E250A78AFA89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110217004:2":{"text":"あらぁ、元気がいいモジャモジャちゃんだこと！ウール族、ウール族……聞いたことない名前ねぇ。","source_cn":"哦！曼卡拉可是很少见到这么精神的毛团呢！乌尔氏族……这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F9E653AD7B670C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110217005:1":{"text":"今のうちに覚えておくといい。","source_cn":"你可以从现在开始记住这个名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A1D10EB303F32A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110217006:1":{"text":"あははっ！ウールの代表さんは自信満々ね！皆さん、若いお二人に熱烈な拍手を！","source_cn":"哈哈！乌尔氏族的年轻代表很有自信呢！曼卡拉觉得他值得大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF45722216BC941A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110217007:1":{"text":"自信があるのはいいことだけど、「血の試練」は自信だけじゃ乗り越えられないわよ。","source_cn":"两位有信心自然是好，但“血之试炼”，可不是只靠信心就能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CAA244A23942507","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110217008:1":{"text":"「血の試練」？一回目なのにもう名前からしておっかないなぁ……","source_cn":"“血之试炼”？第一道试炼听起来就这么可怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9842439850BC5E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110217009:1":{"text":"あらら、怖じ気づいちゃった？大丈夫よ、ちょ～っと危ない所に行って、少～し凶暴な相手から大事な宝物を奪ってくるだけだから！","source_cn":"哎呀呀，听起来很可怕吗？没关系，只不过是需要前去不祥之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF604A888BF7843FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1110217009":{"text":"あらら、怖じ気づいちゃった？大丈夫よ、ちょ～っと危ない所に行って、少～し凶暴な相手から大事な宝物を奪ってくるだけだから！","source_cn":"哎呀呀，听起来很可怕吗？没关系，只不过是需要前去不祥之险地，面对莫测之凶兽，掠取其视若珍宝之物，仅此而已！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF604A888BF7843FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110217010:1":{"text":"想像しただけで丸まりたくなってきたよぅ……","source_cn":"光是用听的我已经想把自己团起来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D9436A2585617C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110217011:1":{"text":"うふふっ、ではウール族の勇気ある若者の――","source_cn":"嗯哼！那么请我身边这两位来自乌尔氏族的勇士——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A59D27799969FFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110217012:1":{"text":"ソーン。","source_cn":"索恩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67DACE140CECB2A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110217013:1":{"text":"ア、アルサ……","source_cn":"阿、阿尔萨……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x913543E9546E2C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110217014:1":{"text":"ソーンとアルサ！お二人には一族を代表して<style=\"highlight\">血の試練</style>に挑んでいただきます！美しい鮮血で戦歌祭の開幕を彩ってくださいね！","source_cn":"索恩和阿尔萨！欢迎你们代表乌尔氏族，迎接你们的<sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3C07A6F159C5C3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110217015:1":{"text":"よーくお聞きください！<style=\"highlight\">血の試練</style>の内容は――","source_cn":"请好好听曼卡拉说！<style=highlight>血...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9891662138CC9615","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110217016:1":{"text":"新月の夜にレッドアラクネにあるクモの巣穴へ行き、クモの卵を手に入れて、このマンカラに渡してください！","source_cn":"在新月之夜，赶赴赤沙蛛域的蜘蛛巢穴，将里面的蜘蛛蛋交给我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18CA7FF9B47C78C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110217017:1":{"text":"レッドアラクネ！？あそこは巨大なクモが集まる危険な場所だって、父ちゃんが言ってた。砂が血で赤く染まってるんだって……","source_cn":"赤沙蛛域！我听老爹讲过！那里是盘踞着巨大蜘蛛的凶险之地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB94F7136412E2CCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110217018:2":{"text":"油断は禁物だな。新月の夜ということは……二日後か。","source_cn":"不能掉以轻心。新月之夜……那应该是两天后，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5438DB687AC52A6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110217019:1":{"text":"ええ！二日後の朝にあたしが皆さんを送り出します！","source_cn":"没错！我会在两天后的清晨为勇者们送行的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D20F279D91FC106","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110217020:1":{"text":"それまでにしっかりと準備してくださいな！ちゃんと忠告はしましたからね？","source_c